    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOKIsnqM7J6xAV",
      "title": "feat: Arena-Z Sepolia fee vault recipient update task (sep/072)",
      "author": "donoso-eth",
      "number": 1381,
      "body": "Add task 072 to update fee vault recipient for Arena-Z testnet via L1→L2 deposit transactions. Includes UpdateFeeVaultRecipient template and integration test that replays deposits on L2 fork.\r\n\r\n## Summary\r\n\r\nUpdates the fee vault recipient address on Arena-Z Sepolia (chain 9899) from 0x9648CF2B93DdBbe120812a567294B2954bCc8568 to 0xE75f598754A552841E65f43197C85028874A96a4\r\n\r\nDeploys new fee vault implementations via L1→L2 deposit transactions through OptimismPortal, then upgrades all 3 fee vault proxies (SequencerFeeVault, BaseFeeVault, L1FeeVault)\r\n\r\nFee vaults have immutable recipients baked into constructor bytecode, so changing the recipient requires new impl deployments + proxy upgrades\r\n\r\n## For Task PRs\r\n\r\n**Task path**: `src/tasks/sep/072-arena-z-fee-vault-update`\r\n**Tenderly simulation link**: \r\nFoundation: https://dashboard.tenderly.co/shared/simulation/9b83f4e6-75e2-42f1-93f5-3b791dee57ae\r\nCouncil: https://dashboard.tenderly.co/shared/simulation/5ffefd51-5360-4194-9dbb-37651a7cb35f/state-diff\r\n\r\n### Simulation Checklist\r\n\r\n> These boxes must be checked before your PR can be merged.\r\n\r\n- [x] I have run a Tenderly simulation for this task\r\n- [x] I have reviewed and understand all state changes in the simulation\r\n- [x] I have verified that every state change reflects the **exact expected value** (e.g., if setting an `absolutePrestate`, confirm the precise `bytes32` hash matches expectations)\r\n- [x] All state changes match the expected behavior documented in `VALIDATION.md`\r\n- [x] I can explain every state diff to reviewers and signers\r\n\r\n### Task Checklist\r\n\r\n- [x] `README.md` is complete with accurate task description\r\n- [x] `VALIDATION.md` documents expected state changes with correct domain/message hashes\r\n- [x] Task status is set appropriately\r\n- [x] All TODOs in generated files have been addressed\r\n\r\n\r\n## Additional context\r\n\r\nCreation codes compiled from lib/optimism/packages/contracts-bedrock at submodule commit a10fd5259a (v1.5.0-beta.5)\r\n\r\nBaseFeeVault version will change from 1.5.0-beta.6 to 1.5.0-beta.5 (cosmetic only, functionally identical — single byte difference in version string)\r\n\r\nIncludes reusable template (src/template/UpdateFeeVaultRecipient.sol) and integration test (test/integration/UpdateFeeVaultRecipientIntegration.t.sol)\r\n",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-ops",
      "createdAt": "2026-03-12T05:52:45Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-03-19T12:18:45Z",
      "additions": 354,
      "deletions": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOKIsnqM7LgNVK",
      "title": "Fee vault upgrade template - FeeVaultUpgrader",
      "author": "Wazabie",
      "number": 1387,
      "body": "Fee vault upgrade template based on FeeVaultUpgrader.\r\n\r\nIt differs from the template #1381 because this one deploys new FeeVault implementation contracts to L2 and upgrades the proxies to them via upgradeAndCall + setRecipient in one atomic batch (v1.6.0 settable-recipient approach). UpdateFeeVaultRecipient in #1381 assumes implementations are already deployed and simply calls upgradeTo to point the proxies at them (immutable-recipient approach). ",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-ops",
      "createdAt": "2026-03-18T11:01:35Z",
      "mergedAt": null,
      "additions": 318,
      "deletions": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOKIsnqM7LBG9i",
      "title": "Arena-Z proposer rotation tasks for sepolia and mainnet",
      "author": "Wazabie",
      "number": 1384,
      "body": "Add proposer rotation tasks for Arena-Z (sep/072, eth/048) using SetDisputeGameImpl template. Updates pdgGameArgs with new AltLayer proposer addresses while keeping the same PDG implementation.\r\n\r\nFix SetDisputeGameImpl template to skip gameArgs format validation when fdgGameArgs or pdgGameArgs are empty, supporting permissioned-only chains like Arena-Z that have no FDG.\r\n\r\n### Simulation Checklist\r\n\r\n> These boxes must be checked before your PR can be merged.\r\n\r\n- [ ] I have run a Tenderly simulation for this task\r\n- [ ] I have reviewed and understand all state changes in the simulation\r\n- [ ] I have verified that every state change reflects the **exact expected value** (e.g., if setting an `absolutePrestate`, confirm the precise `bytes32` hash matches expectations)\r\n- [ ] All state changes match the expected behavior documented in `VALIDATION.md`\r\n- [ ] I can explain every state diff to reviewers and signers\r\n\r\n### Task Checklist\r\n\r\n- [ ] `README.md` is complete with accurate task description\r\n- [ ] `VALIDATION.md` documents expected state changes with correct domain/message hashes\r\n- [ ] Task status is set appropriately\r\n- [ ] All TODOs in generated files have been addressed",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-ops",
      "createdAt": "2026-03-16T19:25:38Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-03-19T20:18:41Z",
      "additions": 224,
      "deletions": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOKIsnqM7MO3HG",
      "title": "fix(049): replace Arena-Z fee vault impl with bytecode-verified deployment",
      "author": "Ethnical",
      "number": 1388,
      "body": "## Summary\r\n\r\n- The `defaultFeeVaultImpl` (`0xD7e148FE…`) used for BaseFeeVault and L1FeeVault on Arena-Z was deployed from **non-canonical source** — its `FeeVault.sol` contains a typo in a revert string (`\"feee recipint\"` instead of `\"fee recipient\"`) that **never existed in the optimism monorepo git history**\r\n- The contract bytecode does not match what the monorepo produces at any commit\r\n- Replaced with `0x8ADBa123…` which is **byte-for-byte identical** to the monorepo at commit `bf7e95ce53` (modulo constructor immutables)\r\n- The SequencerFeeVault impl (`0x6B0660A3…`) was already verified correct and is unchanged\r\n\r\n## Bytecode verification\r\n\r\n| Address | Contract | Monorepo Match | Issue |\r\n|---|---|---|---|\r\n| `0xD7e148FE…` (old) | L1FeeVault | **NO** | Typo `\"feee recipint\"` in FeeVault revert string — not from canonical source |\r\n| `0x8ADBa123…` (new) | L1FeeVault | **YES** | 0 byte diffs after neutralizing immutables |\r\n| `0x6B0660A3…` (unchanged) | SequencerFeeVault | **YES** | Already correct |\r\n\r\n## What changed\r\n\r\n- `config.toml`: updated `defaultFeeVaultImpl` to `0x8ADBa123…`\r\n- `README.md`: updated impl addresses for BaseFeeVault and L1FeeVault\r\n- `VALIDATION.md`: updated all references including calldata, state changes, and verification commands\r\n\r\n## Action required\r\n\r\n- Domain and message hashes in VALIDATION.md need recalculation (transaction data changed)\r\n- Re-run simulation to verify the new calldata\r\n\r\nTenderly execution match this -> \r\n<img width=\"1270\" height=\"1428\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-03-20 at 16 15 46@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3317aec7-31b6-45e1-bba1-2b4332450f4b\" />\r\n",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-ops",
      "createdAt": "2026-03-20T19:11:56Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-03-20T19:49:16Z",
      "additions": 22,
      "deletions": 19
    }
  ],
